---
---

<section id="local-first" class="section-padding relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-950 via-surface-975 to-surface-950 pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-1/3 left-0 w-72 h-72 bg-green-500/5 blur-3xl rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="section-container relative z-10">
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-4">
      <span class="gradient-text">本地优先</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-surface-400 text-center mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      支持 Ollama / llama.cpp 本地模型；数据默认存在本机。换用云端 Provider 时，只有那次请求的内容会发给所选的供应商
    </p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <!-- 本地优先优势 -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="glass-card p-6 border-green-500/20">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🏠</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-100">可离线运行</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-surface-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            使用本地 Ollama 或 llama.cpp 模型时，不需要联网也能对话和执行本地工具；
            会话、记忆与知识库都写在本机文件里。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 border-green-500/20">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🔒</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-100">数据默认在本机</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-surface-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            会话、记忆、知识库存放在本地 SQLite 与工作区目录中，
            会话记录以 events.jsonl 追加保存，方便回看与审计。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="glass-card p-6 border-green-500/20">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="text-2xl">🌐</span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-100">按需接入云端</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-surface-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            需要更强的模型时，可在配置里启用云端 Provider（14 类），
            由路由按任务档位选择；也可以只用本地模型。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 两种模式对照 -->
      <div class="glass-card p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-surface-100 mb-4 text-center">本地模式 / 云端模式</h3>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-800/40 border border-surface-800/50">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1">
              <span class="text-surface-400">模型运行位置</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs">
              <span class="text-green-400 font-semibold">本机（Ollama / llama.cpp）</span>
              <span class="text-brand-400">供应商服务器</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-800/40 border border-surface-800/50">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1">
              <span class="text-surface-400">是否需要联网</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs">
              <span class="text-green-400 font-semibold">不需要</span>
              <span class="text-brand-400">需要</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-800/40 border border-surface-800/50">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1">
              <span class="text-surface-400">本次请求内容流向</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs">
              <span class="text-green-400 font-semibold">不出本机</span>
              <span class="text-brand-400">发给所选供应商</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-800/40 border border-surface-800/50">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1">
              <span class="text-surface-400">成本来源</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs">
              <span class="text-green-400 font-semibold">自有算力</span>
              <span class="text-brand-400">按用量计费</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-surface-800/40 border border-surface-800/50">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1">
              <span class="text-surface-400">会话记录</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs">
              <span class="text-green-400 font-semibold">events.jsonl 本机留存</span>
              <span class="text-brand-400">同样本机留存</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
